# A chat on a phone (MBUI_FIXTURE=chat MBUI_WIN=390x844): its composer pressed, two lines written in it: a box, its
# words over the row of ＋ and send (sfpages' composer_node with MBUI_CHAT_PAGE=composed, the old view's with
# MBUI_CHAT_PAGE=nodes).
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 700
type 帮我看一下登录按钮
key enter
type 还有注册页
wait 900
exit
